 ities in these trying times?&#160\;Join the Oregon Service-Learning &amp\
 ; Community Engagement (ORSLCE) Professionals for this story-sharing\, co
 mmunity-building\, strategy-enhancing meeting. We'll have an exciting key
 note speaker\, interactive workshops\, panel discussions and more.—Even
