SUMMARY:Red Cross Blood Drive Cascade
DESCRIPTION:Have you saved a life today? You can by donating blood\, plat
 elets or plasma. The American Red Cross is partnering with PCC's Office o
 f Civic Leadership Development to host a blood drive at the PCC Cascade C
 ampus.Save your spot by going to https://www.redcrossblood.org/give.html/
 find-drive (https://www.redcrossblood.org/give.html/find-drive) and enter
  in sponsor code PCCCASCADE You can save time at the drive by entering in
 formation through the Red Cross Rapid Pass.When you come to give blood\, 
 platelets\, or AB Elite plasma April 13-30\, 2026\, you'll receive a $15 
 e-gift card to a merchant of your choice.* Think of it as our way of sayi
 ng thanks for your support and helping lives blossom.Spring into action b
 y donating blood\, platelet or AB Elite plasma and save a life today!—E
 vent Details: https://hub.pcc.edu/rsvp?id=382454 (https://hub.pcc.edu/rsv
 p?id=382454)
