SUMMARY:Red Cross Blood Drive PCC Rock Creek
DESCRIPTION:Have you saved a life today? You can by donating blood\, plat
 elets or plasma. The American Red Cross is partnering with PCC's Office o
 f Civic Leadership Development to host a blood drive at the PCC Rock Cree
 k.To make an appointment\, visit https://www.redcrossblood.org/give.html/
 find-drive (https://www.redcrossblood.org/give.html/find-drive) and enter
  site code PCCROCK You can save time in line by entering information thro
 ugh the Red Cross Rapid Pass.When you come to give blood\, platelets\, or
  AB Elite plasma April 13-30\, 2026\, you'll receive a $15 e-gift card to
  a merchant of your choice.* Think of it as our way of saying thanks for 
 your support and helping lives blossom.Spring into action by donating blo
 od\, platelet or AB Elite plasma and save a life today!—Event Details: 
 https://hub.pcc.edu/rsvp?id=382455 (https://hub.pcc.edu/rsvp?id=382455)
