SUMMARY:Career Planning 101: Choosing a Major/Career
DESCRIPTION:Almost 50% of first-time college students are undecided on a 
 major\, and up to 80% of students change their major at least once. Wheth
 er you're just starting along your academic path and unsure how to select
  a major\, or you're ready to make a career-pivot\, planning your future 
 can feel like a big decision.Luckily\, the PCC Career Services team is he
 re to help you learn the process with a workshop designed just for you. W
 e'll cover everything from the purpose of taking career-assessments to ho
 w best to research a major. And we'll go over valuable tools\, services\,
  and techniques available to PCC students.Plus\, we'll take time for a Q&
 amp\;A-session\, so you get the opportunity to speak directly with Career
  Services staff.We hope to see you there!To request an accommodation\, pl
 ease contact cap@pcc.edu four days before the event.Meeting Link: https:/
 /portlandcc.zoom.us/meeting/register/OAX7eQDSQFun_TuSF7sHMQ#/registration
  (https://portlandcc.zoom.us/meeting/register/OAX7eQDSQFun_TuSF7sHMQ#/reg
 istration)—Event Details: https://hub.pcc.edu/rsvp?id=382583 (https://h
 ub.pcc.edu/rsvp?id=382583)
