SUMMARY:PCC Retirement Honors
DESCRIPTION:The heart of PCC has always been its people\, and we can't wa
 it to gather once again to honor our newest retirees.  This event is a sp
 ecial opportunity for our community—staff\, faculty\, family and former
  retirees—to come together\, share stories\, and show our deep gratitud
 e for the 2025-2026 PCC retirees.  Please join us in making this a truly 
 memorable gathering on Friday\, May 15\, 2026.  4:00 PM SOCIAL TIME | Enj
 oy yummy bites and fun mocktails before the program  RETIREE RESOURCE FAI
 R | Learn from internal and external partners about resources to stay act
 ive in  retirement  5:30 PM RETIREE RECOGNITION | Join colleagues to hono
 r our 2025-2026 PCC Retirees  7:00 PM POST-RECEPTION | Connect with frien
 ds over coffee and sweets  Let us know you're coming by rsvping: https://
 forms.gle/GFfHWQJY2cP95cMV6  $15 per person\; invoice will be provided wi
 th payment details\; prepayment required  Join us for an evening of heavy
  hors d'oeuvres and fun mocktails. We won't be serving a formal dinner\, 
 so be sure to get there early to enjoy the full spread!
