 ople\, and we can't wait to gather once again to honor our newest retiree
 s.<br />  This event is a special opportunity for our community—staff\,
  faculty\, family and former retirees—to come together\, share stories\
 , and show our deep gratitude for the 2025-2026 PCC retirees.</p><p>  Ple
 ase join us in making this a truly memorable gathering on Friday\, May 15
 \, 2026.</p><p>  4:00 PM SOCIAL TIME | Enjoy yummy bites and fun mocktail
 s before the program<br />  RETIREE RESOURCE FAIR | Learn from internal a
 nd external partners about resources to stay active in<br />  retirement<
 br />  5:30 PM RETIREE RECOGNITION | Join colleagues to honor our 2025-20
